{"schemaVersion":"1.0.0","commitSha":"c2534ff9c84422e00711da31629a76f3f59feb98","shard":"f93faa2df85358f8","symbols":[{"path":"xrpl/AMMBid","kind":"class","name":"AMMBid","qualifiedName":"xrpl::AMMBid","scope":"xrpl","category":"production","access":"public","documentation":{"status":"present","brief":[{"type":"link","text":"AMMBid","target":{"path":"xrpl/AMMBid","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"type":"text","text":" implements AMM bid "},{"type":"link","text":"Transactor","target":{"path":"xrpl/Transactor","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This is a mechanism for an AMM instance to auction-off the trading advantages to users (arbitrageurs) at a discounted TradingFee for a 24 hour slot. Any account that owns corresponding LPTokens can bid for the auction slot of that AMM instance. Part of the proceeds from the auction, i.e. LPTokens are refunded to the current slot-holder computed on a pro rata basis. Remaining part of the proceeds - in the units of LPTokens- is burnt, thus effectively increasing the LPs shares. Total slot time of 24 hours is divided into 20 equal intervals. The auction slot can be in any of the following states at any time:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"type":"text","text":"Empty - no account currently holds the slot."}],[{"type":"text","text":"Occupied - an account owns the slot with at least 5% of the remaining slot time (in one of 1-19 intervals)."}],[{"type":"text","text":"Tailing - an account owns the slot with less than 5% of the remaining time. The slot-holder owns the slot privileges when in state Occupied or Tailing. If x is the fraction of used slot time for the current slot holder and X is the price at which the slot can be bought specified in LPTokens then: The minimum bid price for the slot in first interval is f(x) = X * 1.05 + min_slot_price The bid price of slot any time is f(x) = X * 1.05 * (1 - x^60) + min_slot_price, where min_slot_price is a constant fraction of the total LPTokens. The revenue from a successful bid is split between the current slot-holder and the pool. The current slot holder is always refunded the remaining slot value f(x) = (1 - x) * X. The remaining LPTokens are burnt. The auction information is maintained in AuctionSlot of ltAMM object. AuctionSlot contains: Account - account id, which owns the slot. Expiration - slot expiration time DiscountedFee - trading fee charged to the account, default is 0. Price - price paid for the slot in LPTokens. AuthAccounts - up to four accounts authorized to trade at the discounted fee."}]]}],"returns":null,"notes":[{"kind":"see","content":[{"type":"url","text":"XLS30d:Continuous Auction Mechanism","href":"https://github.com/XRPLF/XRPL-Standards/discussions/78"}]}],"suppressionReason":null,"inheritedFrom":null},"location":{"declaration":{"file":"include/xrpl/tx/transactors/dex/AMMBid.h","line":53},"definition":{"file":"include/xrpl/tx/transactors/dex/AMMBid.h","line":54,"endLine":84}},"corrections":[],"templateParameters":null,"isTemplateSpecialization":false,"isFinal":false,"isAbstract":false,"baseClasses":[{"name":"xrpl::Transactor","target":{"path":"xrpl/Transactor","resolution":"doxygen"},"access":"public","isVirtual":false}],"derivedClasses":[],"friends":[],"deductionGuides":[],"nested":[],"members":["xrpl/AMMBid/kConsequencesFactory","xrpl/AMMBid/AMMBid/29ef2f56","xrpl/AMMBid/doApply/e406d9b8","xrpl/AMMBid/visitInvariantEntry/d797a176","xrpl/AMMBid/finalizeInvariants/7c5b8a6e","xrpl/AMMBid/checkExtraFeatures/89a7ead5","xrpl/AMMBid/preflight/dd53031c","xrpl/AMMBid/preclaim/0dd09ce9"],"declaration":[{"text":"class AMMBid : public "},{"text":"xrpl::Transactor","target":{"path":"xrpl/Transactor","resolution":"doxygen"}}]},{"path":"xrpl/AMMBid/kConsequencesFactory","kind":"variable","name":"kConsequencesFactory","qualifiedName":"xrpl::AMMBid::kConsequencesFactory","scope":"xrpl/AMMBid","category":"production","access":"public","documentat